{"id":"a1124a8442d20801","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-normal.md","title":"Normal Function","display":"df-normal — Normal Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-normal","aliases":["58-df-normal"],"display":"df-normal — Normal Function","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-normal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-normal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-normal — Normal Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"30f7fa6c101bbb39\" href=\"?note=30f7fa6c101bbb39\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md\">../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta,f,B\\in V\">\\(\\delta,f,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the set-function predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Limit}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Limit}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the nonzero-limit-ordinal predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Normal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Normal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Normal}_S(f,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\n\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\delta,B)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(f(\\alpha))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\delta\\;\n(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)&lt;f(\\beta))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Limit}(\\lambda)\\to\nf(\\lambda)=\\bigcup\\{f(\\xi):\\xi\\in\\lambda\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Normal}_S(f,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\n\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\delta,B)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(f(\\alpha))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\delta\\;\n(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)&lt;f(\\beta))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Limit}(\\lambda)\\to\nf(\\lambda)=\\bigcup\\{f(\\xi):\\xi\\in\\lambda\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Normality is relative to the ordinal domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>; continuity is required only at nonzero limit ordinals below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The ordinal-valued condition is expressed pointwise with a set codomain witness, rather than treating the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> as a function codomain.</li>\n<li>The <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph\">\\(\\aleph\\)</span> function and the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beth\">\\(\\beth\\)</span> function are normal.</li>\n<li>Continuity is stated as union at exactly the nonzero limit ordinals selected by the source predicate, and the range is pointwise ordinal-valued without using the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> as a codomain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"30f7fa6c101bbb39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-limit-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\delta,f,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Limit}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Normal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Normal}_S(f,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\delta)\n\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\delta,B)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(f(\\alpha))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\delta\\;\n(\\alpha<\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)<f(\\beta))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Limit}(\\lambda)\\to\nf(\\lambda)=\\bigcup\\{f(\\xi):\\xi\\in\\lambda\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph","display":false},{"tex":"\\beth","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false}],"bytes":1726,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-161","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-normal]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-886","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-normal.md|58-df-normal]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2","30f7fa6c101bbb39"]}